Provides: workspace-mcp
Description: stdio MCP server for Google Workspace
 Model Context Protocol (MCP) server for Google Workspace: Gmail, Drive,
 Calendar, Docs, Sheets, Slides, Forms, Tasks, Contacts, Chat, Apps Script
 and Programmable Search. Set WORKSPACE_MCP_READ_ONLY=true to request only
 read-only scopes and expose only read-only tools.
 Fork of taylorwilsdon/google_workspace_mcp.

Package: mcprack-mcp-server-googleoffice
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
 mcprack (>= 1.6.0),
 mcp-server-googleoffice (= ${binary:Version}),
Description: Registers Google Workspace MCP server into mcprack catalog
 Companion package for mcp-server-googleoffice. Installing it registers
 the mcp-server-googleoffice binary as an available MCP server in the
 local mcprack instance; removing it unregisters it again.
